/Title (This report consolidates data on 44 Tier 1 engineering colleges across 18 Indian states into a single intelligence database, and analyzes it to explain why certain institutions consistently out-place others. The analysis moves beyond simple rankings to quantify the relationships between accreditation, ownership, location, alumni strength, and recruiter compensation, giving ACC an evidence-based view of what actually drives placement outcomes at the top of the Indian engineering education system. Headline findings:)
